        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "effect": "Causes the Meteorite to transform to its final form, allowing Rayquaza to Mega Evolve.",
      "short_effect": "Causes the Meteorite to transform to its final form, allowing Rayquaza to Mega Evolve.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "いしのどうくつに　おちていた\nいんせきのかけらの　ひとつ。\nふれると　ほのかに　あたたかい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "바위 동굴에 떨어진\n운석조각 중의 하나.\n만지면 은근히 따뜻하다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "掉落在石之洞窟裡的\n隕石碎片之一。\n摸起來有點暖暖的。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "L’un des fragments de météorite tombés dans\nla Grotte Granite. Il est légèrement tiède\nau toucher.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eines der Meteoritenstücke aus der Granithöhle.\nWenn man es berührt, wird es ein bisschen warm.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Trozo de meteorito encontrado en el suelo de la\nCueva Granito. Es ligeramente cálido al tacto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Frammento di meteorite trovato nella Grotta\nPietrosa. Toccandolo, si avverte un certo calore.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "One of the fragments of a Meteorite from\nGranite Cave. It’s faintly warm to the touch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "石の洞窟に　落ちていた\nいんせきのかけらの　ひとつ。\n触れると　ほのかに　暖かい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "掉落在石之洞窟里的\n陨石碎片之一。\n摸上去有一点点暖暖的。",
